# ---- Node (bundled TipTap editor build) ----
editor/node_modules/
editor/npm-debug.log*
# Verbatim copy of editor/src/editor.html, rewritten by build.mjs on every build. The source is the
# file worth reviewing; the copy is not. (editor.bundle.js/editor.css stay committed — see the note
# at the bottom.)
Assets/editor/editor.html

# ---- Secrets ----
# Self-signed MSIX signing key — regenerate locally; don't publish it.
*.pfx

# ---- OS cruft ----
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# NOTE: these are intentionally NOT ignored (committed as build inputs/fallbacks):
#   Assets/editor/editor.bundle.js, editor.css, preview.html
#                           - prebuilt editor assets the app inlines at build (editor.html is
#                             ignored above; run `node build.mjs` in /editor after a fresh clone)
#   Assets/Manual.pdf       - fallback manual (regenerated from docs/Manual.md at build)
